    A009["<div class='arg'><b>A009 · PREDICTION</b><div class='core pred'><span>Warsh in the presser is as Warsh was at Jackson Hole.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Warsh's Jackson Hole-style presser is largely to support the bond.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>P:</b> Markets once again question the Fed's commitment to the 2% inflation target.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c view'><span><b>Q:</b> In responding to questions about the policy path going forward, Warsh faces a balancing act.</span><b>[H]</b></div><div class='c fc'><span><b>CN:</b> Markets quickly price in over 100bp of hikes.</span><b>[H]</b></div></div>"]
